  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 1
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: I couldn't say no. Besides... you are a young boy who needs care.
      nextNodeID: 2
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: Take care, okay?
      nextNodeID: 3
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 2
    nextNodeID: 4
    text: Humph. I don't need care. ...But I admit that I'm still a kid who needs
      help to protect my family.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Bion
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 3
    nextNodeID: 4
    text: Wait are you leaving? ...Hey...so...
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Bion
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 4
    nextNodeID: Smile
    text: Thank you for helping me, and giving me another chance. I couldn't see
      another solution, but now I know that there are good adults like you.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Bion
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: Smile
    nextNodeID: 
    text: I'm glad I could help you see the world in a different light, kid. May
      the gods bless you and your family.
    choices: []
